I do prefer brivla over cmevla for Lojban-derived names, and if I myself 
were to refer to the LLG with a brivla, I would probably use {la 
lojbangri}. It's shorter than {lojbangirzu}, but uses -ban- instead of the 
lower-scoring -bau- for better assonance with "Lojban" and the common 
cmevla.

